    {
      "id": "C13",
      "kind": "recommendation",
      "text": "Taken together, the experiments favor a selective recovery policy with four properties: route only faults that are plausibly recoverable, cap attempts and per-request budgets, gate fallback on answer quality, and preserve provenance so fallback behavior remains measurable.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "artifact": "day19/evidence/q3_conclusion.json",
          "pointer": ""
        },
        {
          "artifact": "day21/evidence/availability_quality_comparison.json",
          "pointer": "/metric_definitions"
        },
        {
          "artifact": "day24/evidence/q5_recommendation.json",
          "pointer": "/tradeoff"
        }
      ],
      "bindings": [],
      "limitations": [
        "L01",
        "L04",
        "L05",
        "L06",
        "L07",
        "L08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C14",
      "kind": "method",
      "text": "The evidence base consists of 500 seeded trials per Q1 depth, 44 labelled Q2 examples, 200 shared seeds per Q3 retry scenario, 120 paired Q4 requests, and 400 shared Q5 policy seeds. Each experiment keeps availability, correctness, cost, and latency as separate fields rather than collapsing them into one score.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "artifact": "day07/evidence/q1_results.json",
          "pointer": "/config/trials"
        },
        {
          "artifact": "day15/evidence/q2_results.json",
          "pointer": "/full_labelled_set/n_samples"
        },
        {
          "artifact": "day19/evidence/retry_sweep.json",
          "pointer": "/params/N"
        },
        {
          "artifact": "day21/evidence/availability_quality_comparison.json",
          "pointer": "/params/n"
        },
        {
          "artifact": "day24/evidence/policy_comparison.json",
          "pointer": "/config/n"
        }
      ],
      "bindings": [
        {
          "token": "500",
          "artifact": "day07/evidence/q1_results.json",
          "pointer": "/config/trials"
        },
        {
          "token": "44",
          "artifact": "day15/evidence/q2_results.json",
          "pointer": "/full_labelled_set/n_samples"
        },
        {
          "token": "200",
          "artifact": "day19/evidence/retry_sweep.json",
          "pointer": "/params/N"
        },
        {
          "token": "120",
